    {
      "name": "逐个位置回归，比较 F 比",
      "description": "每换一个位置γ，都平移样本、做一次White回归并计算F；比较后保留F最大的那组参数。",
      "formula": {
        "expression": "\\begin{gathered}Y_i=\\ln(t_i-\\gamma)=a+bX_i\\\\[5pt] b=\\frac{\\sum(X_i-\\bar X)(Y_i-\\bar Y)}{\\sum(X_i-\\bar X)^2}\\\\[5pt] F=\\frac{\\sum(Y_i-\\bar Y)^2/(n-1)}{\\sum(Y_i-a-bX_i)^2/(n-2)}\\end{gathered}\\qquad\\hat\\gamma=\\arg\\max_\\gamma F(\\gamma)",
